<title>FINLAND: Amer suspended, info due at 1300/1000 GMT.</title>
<headline>Amer suspended, info due at 1300/1000 GMT.</headline>
<dateline>HELSINKI 1997-05-06</dateline>
<text>
<p>Trade in shares of Finnish sport goods group Amer-yhtyma Oy was suspended before opening on Tuesday morning at the company's own request, the Helsinki stock exchange said in a statement.</p>
<p>An Amer spokeswoman said by telephone that the company would release a statement at 1300/1000 GMT. She did not elaborate.  </p>
<p>On Monday, Amer's share closed at 93.00 markka in Helsinki. The year-high price is 110.00 markka and the year-low is 89.00 markka. --Helsinki newsroom +358-9-680 50 245, news@reuters.fi</p>
</text>
